0..70 Comment "// A functor over a theory\'s models (#1226): a parameter written `(S :"
71..147 Comment "// Model(T))` takes the signature the theory `T` derives, its sorts abstract"
148..224 Comment "// in the body and its operations values at the types the theory states, and"
225..300 Comment "// an application matches its argument against that signature by name, so a"
301..375 Comment "// module ascribed the record signature the theory presents is an argument"
376..451 Comment "// as a model is. After Kaposi and Xie (_Second-Order Generalised Algebraic"
452..514 Comment "// Theories: Signatures and First-Order Semantics_, FSCD 2024,"
515..587 Comment "// doi:10.4230/LIPIcs.FSCD.2024.10), under which a module signature is a"
588..654 Comment "// theory and a parameterised module the static half of a functor."
656..708 Comment "/// A magma: a carrier and a binary operation on it."
